sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Sensor SessionManager
    participant ATECC as ATECC608 TempKey
    participant LoRa as LoRa host-owned
    participant Gateway as Gateway SessionManager
    participant Crypto as SecureElement host implementation

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Renew P-256 éphémère, sans rétrocompatibilité X25519
    Note over Sensor: start_renew(peer, now)
    Sensor->>Sensor: AEAD old s2g (plaintext vide)
    Sensor->>LoRa: RenewRequest, 47 octets

    LoRa->>Gateway: RenewRequest sous ancienne clé
    Gateway->>Gateway: AEAD + anti-rejeu
    Gateway->>Crypto: generate_ephemeral_keypair()
    Crypto-->>Gateway: gateway_pub[33] + contexte opaque[32]
    Gateway->>Gateway: Conserve le contexte zéroïsable dans pending
    Gateway->>LoRa: RenewChallenge, 84 octets<br/>gateway_pub_compressed[33] + lifetime[4], ancienne clé

    Note over Sensor: continue_renew(challenge, se, now)
    LoRa->>Sensor: RenewChallenge sous ancienne clé
    Sensor->>Sensor: AEAD + anti-rejeu + lifetime
    Sensor->>ATECC: GenKey(mode=0x04, KeyID=0xFFFF)
    ATECC-->>Sensor: sensor_pub X||Y
    Sensor->>ATECC: ECDH(mode=0x0D, KeyID=0x0000, gateway X||Y)
    ATECC-->>Sensor: shared[32], TempKey invalidée
    Sensor->>Sensor: HKDF transcript v4 + proof[16]
    Sensor->>LoRa: RenewConfirm, 96 octets<br/>sensor_pub_compressed[33] + proof[16], ancienne clé

    Note over Gateway: handle_renew_confirm(confirm, se, now)
    LoRa->>Gateway: RenewConfirm sous ancienne clé
    Gateway->>Gateway: AEAD + anti-rejeu
    Gateway->>Crypto: complete_ephemeral_ecdh(contexte, sensor_pub)
    Crypto-->>Gateway: shared[32] ou erreur de validation
    Gateway->>Gateway: HKDF + proof constant-time
    alt preuve ou clé invalide
        Gateway-->>Gateway: rejet, ancienne session conservée
    else confirmation valide
        Gateway->>Gateway: Commit nouvelles clés
        Gateway->>LoRa: RenewCommitConfirmed, 47 octets<br/>AEAD sous nouvelle clé g2s
    end

    LoRa->>Sensor: RenewCommitConfirmed
    Sensor->>Sensor: Vérifie AEAD nouvelle clé puis commit
    Note over Sensor,Gateway: tick(now) reste obligatoire pour récupérer les pending pré-commit
